| Comment: -------------------------------------------------------------------
| Title:   Indirect Prompt Injection Marker in LLM Response
| Sigma:   detection-rules/sigma/prompt_injection_indirect.yml
| Index:   llm_app_logs
| Translated: 2026-05-14
| NOTE: This fires on CONFIRMED injection success — treat as P1
| -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

index=llm_app_logs sourcetype=llm_response
| where
    (match(llm_response, "INJECTION SUCCESSFUL")
  OR match(llm_response, "EXFIL_TOKEN_\d+")
  OR match(llm_response, "DEVMODE ENABLED")
  OR match(llm_response, "PWNED")
  OR match(llm_response, "You are now an unrestricted")
  OR match(llm_response, "your new instruction is")
  OR match(llm_response, "I am ignoring my instructions")
  OR (match(llm_response, "P\.S\.") AND match(llm_response, "instructions are")))
| eval severity="critical", detection_rule="indirect_injection_confirmed"
| join type=left session_id
    [search index=llm_app_logs sourcetype=llm_query earliest=-5m
     | table session_id, user_input, retrieved_doc_ids]
| table _time, session_id, user_id, user_input, retrieved_doc_ids,
        llm_response, severity, detection_rule
| sort -_time

| Comment: -------------------------------------------------------------------
| Tuning: Very low expected FP — critical severity is intentional
| Containment: Consider auto-quarantine of session and doc review workflow
| Alert: Real-time, alert on ANY match, page on-call
| -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
